<title>SPAIN: GOLF-MCNULTY WINS VOLVO MASTERS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MCNULTY WINS VOLVO MASTERS.</headline>
<dateline>SOTOGRANDE, Spain 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwean Mark McNulty won the Volvo Masters on Sunday when he shot a three-under-par 68 at Valderrama.</p>
</text>
